  "description": "电竞大脑 (formerly 智能BP). One model of your save's meta - champion strength per patch, lanes, players' own strength and mastery, synergies and matchups - fitted in the background. League champions start from built-in League knowledge (lanes, team-composition profile, competitive tier, known combos and counters). Ban/pick screen: your line-up's win chance, the best picks now and, in every ban phase (3+2 included), the three best bans - valued by how much worse they make the enemy's draft, with reasons - or the bans the enemy wants against you; on your turn in a 3+2 draft the best candidates are played out to the end of the draft; both sides' composition style and gaps, the enemy's likely next picks from their habits, a value breakdown for the champion in the info panel, Fearless-series planning, and a BP review page in F8, each champion's value to you, each enemy pick's likely lane, and the best seating in the swap phase. Tactics screen: the options worth changing. Line-up screen: suggested starters. Meta Analysis page in the left menu (in the new UI: the title bar): champions, pairs, players and training, patch changes, the model. F8 anywhere: tier list, scouting, your players' pools. With coach delegation your own team bans and picks exactly what the panel advises (coach=on) - even with Hell Draft AI installed, which it also predicts: the enemy's likely picks, bans and the lookahead follow how Hell Draft AI drafts. AI Smart BP (ai_bp=on): every AI team bans and picks exactly the way this advice would have it, 3+2 lookahead included, over other draft mods. Champions start from their stats (learned from your matches), and the win chances are calibrated on matches the model was not fitted on. Can also nudge the AI's bans and picks (ban_pick, off by default; from game 0.6.4 around both teams' fielded players: their best champions) and keeps your tier list up to date. Balance patches (balance=on): this mod makes the patches instead of the game - every patch the champions furthest from a 48-52% win rate get stronger or weaker in every match, written into the game's own patch notes and patch history with the patch's news, and the ban/pick and encyclopedia stats show the new numbers. Every champion counts (2.10.0): each win-rate point outside the target moves balance_per_point (2.5% by default) of power, as much as a step was measured to need, up to 80% in all, and champions too rarely picked to judge get a small buff first (balance_unpicked) so that they get played. Item balance (item_balance=on, with alele's 4+6 item pack): the patches change the finished items too - an item whose builders win too much or too little gets its numbers changed, in its own news (2.12.0: the items are judged first, on 3 builders, 50 +- 1 and 10% a point, and the champions' changes count the items'; item_balance_users / _band / _per_point). 2.12.1: the game's item pages (encyclopedia, strategy popup) show a changed item's numbers as its holders play them. 2.12.2: the encyclopedia's patch history shows a patch's item changes too. 2.12.3 (game 0.7.3): the encyclopedia's champion page shows the patched numbers again (0.7.3 hid the page's champion name, which the mod read the champion from).2.11.0: the players' abilities in the model (each match record's abilities and lane rating), so a champion the strongest teams play is rated without its players - the Meta Analysis page shows what each champion's games owed their players and allies; champions whose numbers you change in the database keep exactly your numbers (the balance's earlier changes come off) and balance_skip / item_balance_skip leave the ones you list alone; the item news shows each item's icon; less work on the main screen (the news looked at around patch days only, the history file read in the background). 2.11.1 (game 0.7.3): the new Tank role is a group of its own in the stats part of the model. Old matches the game prunes are kept in the mod folder. Settings: settings.ini in the mod folder.\n\n用一个模型分析存档里的版本环境（英雄每个版本的强度、分位置、选手实力与熟练度、配合与克制）。英雄联盟英雄从内置的英雄联盟经验出发（位置、阵容属性、职业赛场梯队、知名配合与克制）。选人界面：阵容胜率、当前最佳选择；每个禁用阶段（含 3+2）给出最该禁的三个英雄——按禁掉后对方阵容变差多少来算，附理由——对方禁用时显示对方最想禁的；3+2 时轮到你会把最好的几个候选推演到 BP 结束再排序；显示双方阵容类型和缺口、按对方习惯推测的下一手、信息栏上方的估值明细、Fearless 系列赛的保留建议，F8 里有 BP 复盘页；每个英雄对你的价值、敌方英雄的位置推断、换位阶段的最佳分配。战术界面：值得改的战术。首发界面：推荐首发。左侧菜单（新界面在顶部标题栏）的版本分析页：英雄、组合、选手与训练建议、补丁变化、模型。任何界面按 F8：梯队榜、对手侦察、选手英雄池。教练托管时你自己的队伍完全照面板的建议禁和选（coach=on），装了地狱人机（Hell Draft AI）也一样；并能预测地狱人机：对方下一手、对方禁用和推演都按它的方式算。AI 智能BP（ai_bp=on）：所有 AI 队伍完全按本 Mod 的建议禁和选（含 3+2 推演），盖过其他 BP Mod。英雄从自身属性出发（从你的比赛学每项属性值多少），胜率按没参与拟合的比赛校准。可选改进 AI 的 ban/pick（ban_pick，默认关；游戏 0.6.4 起会看双方上场选手的拿手英雄）并自动维护梯队。版本平衡补丁（balance=on）：由本 Mod 代替游戏出补丁——每个版本把胜率离 48%–52% 最远的英雄在所有比赛里调强或调弱，写进游戏自己的补丁公告和补丁历史并发补丁新闻，BP 和百科的英雄属性显示改动后的数值。2.10.0 起照顾到所有英雄：每偏 1 个胜率点调 balance_per_point（默认 2.5%）的强度——按实测一刀该有的幅度——累计最多 80%，很少有人选、没法按胜率判断的英雄先小幅加强（balance_unpicked），让它们有机会上场。装备平衡（item_balance=on，需装 alele 的 4+6 装备包）：补丁也改成品装备——出它的英雄扣掉自身改动后胜率仍偏高或偏低的装备调整数值，单独发新闻。2.11.0：选手能力值进模型（每场比赛记录里选手的能力和位置评分），强队常用的英雄扣掉选手的贡献再评级，版本分析页显示每个英雄的表面胜率靠选手、阵容各得了多少；在数据库里改过数值的英雄完全按你的数值来（之前的平衡调整取消），balance_skip / item_balance_skip 列出的不调整；装备补丁新闻带图标；主界面卡顿优化（新闻只在补丁日前后常看，比赛备份在后台读）。2.11.1（游戏 0.7.3）：新加的坦克职业在模型的属性部分自成一组。2.12.3（游戏 0.7.3）：百科英雄页的「查看当前数值」重新显示补丁后的数值。游戏删掉的旧比赛会保存在 Mod 文件夹里。设置文件 settings.ini 在 Mod 文件夹里。",
